Readme.md
    1→# Commander.js
    8→The complete solution for [node.js](http://nodejs.org) command-line interfaces.
    61→## Installation
    63→```sh
    64→npm install commander
    65→```
    956→## Custom event listeners
    958→You can execute custom actions by listening to `command` and `option` events.
    960→```js
    961→program.on('option:verbose', function () {
    962→  process.env.VERBOSE = this.opts().verbose;
    963→});
    964→```
